WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.880
The medicine works.

00:02.320 --> 00:07.040
But some weight you lose is lean mass, and
lean mass includes muscle.

00:07.840 --> 00:09.920
One summary for your doctor at each
refill.

00:10.640 --> 00:12.840
Your next shot date is always visible.

00:13.560 --> 00:17.540
Then ask your Companion anything. The
Companion remembers you.

00:17.560 --> 00:21.260
In the Kitchen, salmon from Greece,
chicken from Provence,

00:21.900 --> 00:24.900
Teriyaki from Japan. Private by design.

00:25.100 --> 00:30.900
The tracker comes to Google Play in
December to early January, and to the
Apple App Store in February.

00:31.200 --> 00:32.200
Cancel anytime.

